        <h1>THEXRA ENTERPRISE SOLUTION BRIEF</h1>
        <h2>1. Client Problem Statement</h2><p>In the Government sector, Metro Urban Development Authority faces significant operational bottlenecks characterized by "Stakeholders struggle to visualize civil infrastructure impacts from 2D blueprints during public zoning reviews.". This issue stems directly from reliance on Physical foam scale models and static 2D PDF blueprints, which severely hampers throughput and scales errors.</p>
        <h2>2. Proposed Solution</h2><p>Custom THEXRA AR spatial framework designed specifically for Metro Urban Development Authority. It digitizes and automates Physical foam scale models and static 2D PDF blueprints into an interactive, real-time spatial workflow that directly resolves "Stakeholders struggle to visualize civil infrastructure impacts from 2D blueprints during public zoning reviews.".</p>
        <h2>3. Technology Selection</h2><p>AR — THEXRA Spatial Vision (Government Enterprise Edition)</p>
      </body>
